## Standard Library Modules (Rust std)

Used directly across `liphia_compiler`, `liphia_virtual_machine`,
`liphia_cli`, `liphia_pipeline`, and `liphia_stdlib_native`:

| Module | Usage |
|---|---|
| `std::collections::HashMap` | Variable storage in the VM |
| `std::collections::HashSet` | Import cycle detection |
| `std::fs` | Source file reading |
| `std::path` | File path resolution |
| `std::io` | stdin/stdout for `input` and `print` |
| `std::rc::Rc` | Reference-counted string values in the VM |

All covered by the Rust license above.

