## eframe / egui

Used by: `liphia_cli_gui`, `liphia_gui_native`

- **Project:** egui — immediate mode GUI for Rust
- **Authors:** Emil Ernerfeldt and contributors
- **Repository:** https://github.com/emilk/egui
- **Crates:** `eframe`, `egui`
- **Version used:** eframe 0.34.3
- **License:** MIT OR Apache-2.0 (dual license)

`eframe` is the application framework and `egui` is the immediate
mode UI library. Both are dual-licensed MIT/Apache-2.0. These
crates are only compiled into `liphia_cli_gui` — never into the
standard `liphia_cli` binary.

License texts:
- https://github.com/emilk/egui/blob/main/LICENSE-MIT
- https://github.com/emilk/egui/blob/main/LICENSE-APACHE

