## Workspace Crates (internal — no external license)

The following crates are original Liphia source code and are not
third-party software:

| Crate | Description |
|---|---|
| `liphia_compiler` | Lexer, parser, bytecode compiler |
| `liphia_virtual_machine` | Stack-based VM (LVM) |
| `liphia_cli` | Standard command-line interface |
| `liphia_core_native` | Core native functions |
| `liphia_pipeline` | Import resolution and compile pipeline |
| `liphia_cli_gui` | GUI-enabled CLI (opt-in binary) |
| `liphia_gui_native` | GUI native functions (egui commands) |
| `liphia_stdlib_native` | Standard library — all stdlib modules |

---

## PostgreSQL driver (internal implementation)

The PostgreSQL support in `liphia_stdlib_native` uses a hand-written
TCP client implementing the PostgreSQL wire protocol directly,
with no external crate dependency. No third-party license applies.

